            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A review of the utility of oral fluid in drug testing and adherence monitoring in pain management is presented. The article includes a description of the &quot;State of the Art&quot;; drug deposition; advantages and drawbacks of oral fluid testing; and overall related literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
